{
  "id": "platform.getManager.api_error_full",
  "phase": 1,
  "notes": "An API error keeps every field of Alien's error: hint, request ID, internal flag, context and the source chain, each level with its own fields. Every context arrives exactly as sent: an object at the top, an object with a nested object on the first source level, an array with numbers and a null on the second. Nothing of the SDK's is added to a server's context.",
